<HelloFraandsPage title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ki kamaai aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<p>Hosts do not set prices. Every call follows one standard plan, and every host earns the same amount.</p>
<h2>What you earn</h2><p>You earn ₹2.00 for every connected minute of every call. It is paid by the second, so 30 seconds earns ₹1.00. You earn the same ₹2.00 a minute whether the call is short or long. Ringing, missed calls and calls that do not connect earn ₹0.</p>
<h2>Example: a 15-minute call</h2><ul><li>Connected time: 15 minutes.</li><li>You earn: 15 × ₹2.00 = ₹30.00.</li></ul>
<h2>Payouts</h2><p>Your earnings and their payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. New earnings are held for 7 days. The minimum payout is ₹500. Each payout is approved by our team and sent to a bank account or UPI ID in your own name.</p>
<h2>Taxes need final review</h2><p>PAN, TDS, GST treatment and the host earnings statement must be confirmed and disclosed before payouts launch. Tax obligations depend on each host's circumstances; seek independent tax advice if needed.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
